OL,3,ARussell Brand tells court allegations
OL,4,Ahad devastating impact on him
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent
OL,9,FRussell Brand has said a documentary
OL,10,Fthat made allegations about his
OL,11,Fbehaviour had a "devastating" effect on
OL,12,Fhim, and made friends and colleagues
OL,13,Fturn against him.
OL,15,FThe entertainer began giving evidence
OL,16,Fon Wednesday as his defence case got
OL,17,Funder way at his trial at Southwark
OL,18,FCrown Court in London.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
