OL,3,AKing acknowledges 'suffering of the
OL,4,Apast' as Caribbean tour begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe visit, his first as monarch, comes
OL,7,Fin the wake of renewed calls from
OL,8,FCaribbean nations for Britain to
OL,9,Fapologise for its role in selling
OL,10,Fenslaved people for profit.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
