OL,3,ANetanyahu bloc slightly ahead in Israel
OL,4,Aelections but short of majority as 70%
OL,5,Aof votes counted
OL,6,
OL,7,FVoters have been giving their reactions
OL,8,Fto the BBC - from disappointment to
OL,9,Fcautious optimism
OL,11,FAll 120 seats in the Knesset, Israel's
OL,12,Fparliament, are up for grabs, but no
OL,13,Fparty has ever won a majority and in
OL,14,Fthe past governments have been made up
OL,15,Fof coalitions
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
