OL,3,AFlavio Bolsonaro's whereabouts unknown
OL,4,Aafter reports defeated presidential
OL,5,Acandidate left Brazil
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Those who have nothing to hide have
OL,8,Fnothing to fear," says newly re-elected
OL,9,FBrazilian President Lula, remarking on
OL,10,Fhis rival's whereabouts
OL,12,FBolsonaro is under investigation for
OL,13,Falleged corruption and money
OL,14,Flaundering, which he denies
OL,16,FThe right-wing candidate lost the
OL,17,Felection to left-wing Lula but has yet
OL,18,Fto accept the result
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
