OL,3,ALuxury cruise passengers stranded in
OL,4,ACambodia due to soaring fuel costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA luxury cruise ship on a years-long
OL,7,Fvoyage around the world said it
OL,8,Fsuspended operations due to
OL,9,Fextraordinarily high fuel costs,
OL,10,Fleaving passengers stranded in
OL,11,FCambodia.
OL,13,FThe US-based operator of the Villa Vie
OL,14,FOdyssey said it was working with
OL,15,Fpassengers on disembarkation plans and
OL,16,F"temporary living arrangements".
OL,18,FIt is unclear how many were on board
OL,19,Fbut the nearly 200m (656ft) vessel can
OL,20,Fcarry up to 650 passengers. It departed
OL,21,FBelfast in October 2024 for a
OL,22,F"continuous voyage around the world".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
